@host = http://localhost:5173

### Customer by id -> 200, name "Ana"
GET {{host}}/api/customers/1
Accept: application/json

### Unknown customer -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{host}}/api/customers/999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id -> 404 (route constraint)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/abc
Accept: application/json

### GET-6: customers older than 30 + payment count -> 200, Ana (3 payments) and Eva (0); Luis excluded
GET {{host}}/api/customers/over-30
Accept: application/json

### GET-7: 200, Ana {39, 3, 120} then Luis {26, 1, 0}
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=25&maxAge=40

### GET-7: no params -> 200, Ana, Eva, Luis (ties on 0 sorted by name)
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary

### GET-7: 200, Eva {46, 0, 0}
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=40&maxAge=50

### GET-7: inclusive range -> 200, Ana only
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=39&maxAge=39

### GET-7: 200, []
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=27&maxAge=38

### GET-7: minAge > maxAge -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=40&maxAge=30

### GET-7: out of range -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?minAge=-1

### GET-7: not a number -> 400
GET {{host}}/api/customers/order-summary?maxAge=abc

### GET-8: 200, Ana {39, 3 orders, 3 payments, 220} then Eva {46, 0, 0, 0}; no Luis
GET {{host}}/api/customers/activity

### Todos sample
GET {{host}}/todos/
Accept: application/json

###
